<title>USA: Oxboro Medical increases credit line.</title>
<headline>Oxboro Medical increases credit line.</headline>
<dateline>HAM LAKE, Minn. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oxboro Medical International Inc said Wednesday it has entered into an agreement with Norwest Bank Minnesota, NA, to increase the company's line of credit to $1.5 million from $1 million.</p>
<p>The new agreement contains terms more favorable to the company and the increase will allow the company flexibility for growth, Oxboro Medical said.</p>
<p>Oxboro Medical shares fell 5/64 to 1-7/64 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
